aded","size":2650,"digest":"sha256:874c7d222d910593d84a647642d9302e160ba4cf1f62b518b91c4295a5e114de","download_count":68,"created_at":"2026-10-18T03:56:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:56:09Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/releases/download/v0.5.1/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storytold/craft-launcher/tarball/v0.5.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storytold/craft-launcher/zipball/v0.5.1","body":"## What's Changed\n* Sharpen text and lines in the Windows launcher by @Skyfuller1303 in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/339\n* Preserve unrelated backup paths during app updates by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/332\n* fix(update): a Flatpak-installed launcher gets the bundle download link, not the AppImage by @dylanmtaylor in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/370\n* feat(install): choose where Craft apps are installed by @arnav-hiwarkar in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/461\n* feat(catalog, ci): align app numbering with website, drop AppGroup, and standardize nix and freebsd workflows by @dylanmtaylor in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/507\n* Reject corrupt and future self-update timestamps by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/492\n* Stop download retry loops when a partial file cannot be removed by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/495\n* Fix Intel macOS selection of ARM-only DMGs by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/414\n* Preserve unrelated files when saving launcher state by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/314\n* Resolve MSI package paths before installing or self-updating by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/356\n* Zoom release-note text independently by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/351\n* macOS: minimize ArtCraft Launcher with Command+M by @MMexicann in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/350\n* feat: open Discord desktop app when installed instead of browser by @dylanmtaylor in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/566\n* linux: support self-update and restart for Flatpak launcher by @dylanmtaylor in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/190\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Skyfuller1303 made their first contribution in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/339\n* @arnav-hiwarkar made their first contribution in https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/pull/461\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/compare/v0.4.1...v0.5.1","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storytold/craft-launcher/releases/416219874/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":4}